  "compatibility_decisions": [
    "Canonical output retains inventoried snake_case paths and the explicitly inventoried source key fileName.",
    "Unproven replay/tick map, mode, and variant display aliases are excluded; map_name, multiplayer_map_name, and game_type remain the supported fallbacks.",
    "Artifact provenance is generated by the projection and is not copied from canonical source bytes.",
    "Root string events are retained; tick-local live-normalization events are excluded.",
    "Current kill and death tick maps retain bounded position arrays; null position axes represent unavailable producer coordinates and are preserved inside positional arrays.",
    "Graph and coverage parents are fixture-only in the current viewer and are excluded from revision 1."
  ]
